{{Quote|Wait. They said fifty years old.''"<br />"''Species age differently. Perhaps it could live many centuries.|Din Djarin and IG-11 upon discovering [[Din Grogu|Grogu]]|<ref name="Chapter 1: The Mandalorian">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 1: The Mandalorian}}</ref>}}
A '''standard century''',<ref name="Catalyst">''[[Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel]]''</ref> also referred to simply as a '''century''', was a unit used to measure [[time]], equivalent to one hundred [[standard year]]s.<ref name="DV3">[[Darth Vader (2015) 3|''Darth Vader'' (2015) 3]]</ref> It can also be used for a group of plants.<ref name="The Axe Forgets">{{Andor|The Axe Forgets}}</ref>

